{"id":"G3686","lemma":"ὄνομα","transliteration":"onoma","sayIt":"onoma","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, neuter","gloss":"name","meaning":"ὄνομα, -τος, τό,\n[in LXX chiefly for שֵׁם ;]\n1. in general, the name by which a person or thing is called: Mat.10:2, Mrk.3:16, Luk.1:63, Jhn.18:10, al.; ἄνθρωπος (etc.), ᾧ (οὗ) ὄ. (τ. ὄ), sc. ἦν or ἐστίν (BL, §30, 3), Mrk.14:32, Luk.1:26, 27; with same ellipsis, καὶ τ. ὄ. αὐτοῦ, Luk.1:5, Jhn.1:6, al.; ὀνόματι, before nom. prop., Mat.27:32, Mrk.5:22, Luk.1:5, Act.5:1, al.; accusative absol. (Bl., §34, 7), τοὔνομα (= τ. ὄνομα), Mat.27:57; ὄ. μοι (sc. ἐστίν; cf. Hom., Od., ix, 366), Mrk.5:9 (cf. Luk.8:30); ἔξειν ὄ., Rev.9:11; καλεῖν (ἐπιτιθέναι) ὄ. (Bl., §33, 1), Mat.1:21, Mrk.3:16; τ. ὄ. ἐν (τ.) βίβλῳ ζωῆς (cf. Deiss., LAE, 121), Php.4:3, Rev.13:8, cf. Luk.10:20 (ἐν τ. οὐρανοῖς); ὄ. βλασφημίας, Rev.13:1; the name as opposite to the reality, Rev.3:1 (cf. Hdt., vii, 138); as a title: Eph.1:21, Php.2:9, 10 (Lft., in l.).\n2. By a usage similar to that with ref. to Heb. שֵׁם (Lft., Notes, 106f.), but also common in Hellenistic (M, Pr., 100; Bl., §39, 4; Deiss, BS, 146f., 196f.; LAE, 123:4, of all that the name implies, of rank, authority, character, etc.: of acting on one's authority or in his behalf, ἐν (εἰς) ὄ., with genitive of person(s) (see reff. supr.), Mat.10:41 21:9 28:19, Mrk.11:9, Luk.13:35, Jhn.5:43, Act.8:16, 1Co.1:13; of the name Christian, 1Pe.4:16; esp. of the name of God as expressing the divine attributes: ἁγιάζειν (ἅγιον) τὸ ὄ. (τ. Πατρός, Κυρίου), Mat.6:9, Luk.1:49 11:2; ψάλλειν (ὁμολογεῖν) τῷ ὀ., Rom.15:9, Heb.13:15; δοξάζειν (φανεροῦν, φοβεῖσθαι) τὸ ὄ., Jhn.12:28 17:6, 26 Rev.11:18 15:4; βλασφημεῖν, Rom.2:24, 1Ti.6:1, Rev.13:6; similarly, of the name of Christ: τ. καλὂν ὄ. (Deiss., LAE, 276); πιστεύειν τῷ ὀ., 1Jn.3:23; π. εἰς τ. ὄ. (Bl., §39, 4), Jhn.1:12 2:23 3:18; ὀνομάζειν τὸ ὄ., 2Ti.2:19; κρατεῖν, Rev.2:13; οὐκ ἀρνεῖσθαι, Rev.3:8; ἐν τ. ὀ. (see reff. supr.), Mrk.9:38 16:[17], Luk.10:17, Jhn.14:13 16:23, 24 20:31, Act.3:6 4:12, Eph.5:20, 1Pe.4:14, al.; εἰς τ. ὄ. συνάγεσθαι, Mat.18:20; ἕνεκεν τοῦ ὀ., Mat.19:29; διὰ τὸ ὄ., Mat.10:22, Mrk.13:13, al.; διὰ τοῦ ὀ., 1Co.1:10; ὑπὲρ τοῦ ὀ., Act.9:16, Rom.1:5, al.; id. absol., Act.5:41, 3Jo.7; πρὸς τὸ ὄ., Act.26:9.\n3. cause, ground, reason (in cl., usually in bad sense, pretext): Mrk.9:41 (Swete, in l.; Dalman, Words, 305f.).\n4. In late Greek (Deiss., BS., 196f.), an individual, a person: Act.1:15, Rev.3:4 11:13.\n(AS)","glosses":["name","named","names","called","not","him"],"count":211,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-1","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"name","kjv":"name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-1","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"Him","kjv":"name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-1","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"he gave Him the name","kjv":"name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-6","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-7","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"name","kjv":"name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"names","kjv":"the names"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"name","kjv":"name's sake"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":41,"renderings":{"bsb":"because he is","kjv":"the name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"because he is My","kjv":"the name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-12","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"name","kjv":"name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"name","kjv":"name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"name","kjv":"name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-19","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"name","kjv":"name's"}},{"chapterId":"mat-21","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"the name","kjv":"the name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":39,"renderings":{"bsb":"the name","kjv":"the name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-24","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"name","kjv":"name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-24","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"named","kjv":"by name"}},{"chapterId":"mat-28","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"name","kjv":"the name"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-3","v":16,"renderings":{"kjv":"he 